OL,3,GNEWSALeague-winning youth darts team
OL,4,A'like another family'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter winning their league last season,
OL,7,Fthe Black Country Youth County Darts
OL,8,Fteam is riding high.
OL,10,F"It's just gone from strength to
OL,11,Fstrength," team manager Andy Poole told
OL,12,FBBC Radio WM.
OL,14,FLast season, the team had 28 players
OL,15,Fbut has since grown to 33 for the
OL,16,Fforthcoming season, as well as
OL,17,Fincreasing its number of female players
OL,18,Ffrom four to seven.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
